ARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: -10pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 신청기한 :</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 2012. 10. 26(금) ~ 11. 05(월)까지</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 대상업체 : 성공 CEO 포럼 회원사(</span><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"http://www.sceoforum.kr/\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">http://www.sceoforum.kr/</font></a></span></u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\"> - 회원정보)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 선발방법 : 선착순으로 희망업체 배정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 안내사항 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T\">신청자는 협약식 참석을 의무로 하며, 사업단 주관 신기술견학 신청시 가산점 부여</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\">7. 멘토/멘티 사업</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 447.84pt; HEIGHT: 262.71pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 22pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 목 적</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 22pt\" class=\"바탕글\"