: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 진행방법 : 사업단에서 업체와 학생을 연결해주면 수시로 업체 멘토와 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 22pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 22pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;메일 or 유무선 전화, 개별상담 등을 통하여 상담 방식으로 진행</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 22pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 22pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T\">※ 멘토/멘티 사업 협약식 개최</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 22pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 22pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 일시 : 12.11.09(금) 14:00 ~ 10(토) 15:00</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 22pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 22pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼모음T; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼모음T; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼모음T\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 장소 : 문경 리조트</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-B